  "body": "### Describe the feature you'd like to request\n\nCurrently, if the IP, hostname, or domain changes, you need to update the full URL in every individual app configuration.\n\nIt would be really helpful to have a way to maintain a list of base addresses (e.g. `https://10.10.0.10`, `https://192.168.1.4`) and then simply select one when setting up an app, only adding the port it runs on. This would save a lot of repetitive editing whenever there are address changes, or during initial setup.\n\nAs a bonus being able to easily switch between http and https would be helpful.\n\n### Additional information\n\n_No response_",
